09:08.540 --> 09:08.900
Liu Shao!

09:08.900 --> 09:09.430
Liu Shao!

09:16.340 --> 09:16.810
Liu Shao!

09:16.810 --> 09:17.340
Liu Shao!

09:17.900 --> 09:18.460
Liu Shao!

09:19.180 --> 09:20.540
